{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:083e1242f5139664","name":"Smuggling Contraband","source":{"id":"source:reference-083e1242f5139664","title":"Smuggling Contraband","revision":21255,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:26:41Z","sha256":"b2b871ca2158b41cf3067bc1a39797ba93fd648da15aaf16baca906516a907b5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21255","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Smuggling%20Contraband&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-083e1242f5139664","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," represents smuggling goods past government officials. The goal is to move the contraband, which is currently in the hold of the heroes' ship, to the intended buyer without being caught by the authorities. This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," can start when the heroes arrive in the star system where the goods are to be delivered, and continue through the process of landing on the planet and unloading the contraband into the buyer's waiting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Smuggling Contraband Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 3 (11 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag"